# --- Finished runs -------------------------------------------------------
# Every LPF run writes its output into the directory it is launched from.
# The run INPUTS (run.json, start.pdb, header.pdb, path, ligand/, files/) are
# tracked; the outputs are not — they are hundreds of MB of decoy archives and
# trajectory PDBs that would be baked into git history forever.
#
# Reproduce them by following demo/tutorial.md, or download the reference runs
# archived on Zenodo: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23183178
demo/coarse_path/run/
demo/trajectory/run/
examples/coarse_path/run/
examples/trajectory/run/

# Output of a run launched anywhere else in the tree
window_*/
window_*.zip
checkpoint.pkl
checkpoint_meta.json
stats.pkl
score.sc
run.stdout
run.stderr
task.log
task.err
